{"seq":4,"slug":"scriptable-objects","title":"ScriptableObject 数据架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/scriptable-objects","wordCount":980,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"scriptableobject-数据架构\">ScriptableObject 数据架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ScriptableObject 是 Unity 中一种不依赖 GameObject 的数据容器类。与 MonoBehaviour 必须挂载在场景对象上不同，ScriptableObject 作为独立的资源文件存在于 Project 面板中，可以跨场景共享、编辑器中持久化，并且在运行时多个对象引用同一份数据实例。这种设计天然适合存储游戏配置、共享运行时状态和构建数据驱动的架构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph ScriptableObject 架构&#10;        A[ScriptableObject 资源] --&gt;|引用| B[MonoBehaviour A]&#10;        A --&gt;|引用| C[MonoBehaviour B]&#10;        A --&gt;|引用| D[MonoBehaviour C]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 传统方式&#10;        E[MonoBehaviour X] --&gt;|各自持有副本| F[数据副本 1]&#10;        G[MonoBehaviour Y] --&gt;|各自持有副本| H[数据副本 2]&#10;        I[MonoBehaviour Z] --&gt;|各自持有副本| J[数据副本 3]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph ScriptableObject 架构\n        A[ScriptableObject 资源] --&gt;|引用| B[MonoBehaviour A]\n        A --&gt;|引用| C[MonoBehaviour B]\n        A --&gt;|引用| D[MonoBehaviour C]\n    end\n    subgraph 传统方式\n        E[MonoBehaviour X] --&gt;|各自持有副本| F[数据副本 1]\n        G[MonoBehaviour Y] --&gt;|各自持有副本| H[数据副本 2]\n        I[MonoBehaviour Z] --&gt;|各自持有副本| J[数据副本 3]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>ScriptableObject</th>\n<th>MonoBehaviour</th>\n<th>静态类</th>\n<th>JSON 配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖 GameObject</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inspector 编辑</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时内存共享</td>\n<td>单实例共享</td>\n<td>每对象独立</td>\n<td>全局唯一</td>\n<td>需手动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨场景持久化</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>需 DontDestroy</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本控制友好</td>\n<td>.asset 文件</td>\n<td>场景文件</td>\n<td>源码文件</td>\n<td>.json 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热重载</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>需重启</td>\n<td>需重编译</td>\n<td>需重新加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据配置容器\">数据配置容器</h2><p>ScriptableObject 最基础的用途是作为数据配置容器，将游戏参数从代码中抽离到可编辑的资源文件中。通过 <code>CreateAssetMenu</code> 特性，可以在 Project 面板的右键菜单中快速创建数据资产。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(fileName = &quot;NewWeaponData&quot;, menuName = &quot;Game/Weapon Data&quot;)]&#10;public class WeaponData : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    [Header(&quot;基础属性&quot;)]&#10;    public string weaponName;&#10;    public Sprite icon;&#10;    public GameObject prefab;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;战斗数值&quot;)]&#10;    [Range(1, 100)]&#10;    public int damage = 10;&#10;    public float attackSpeed = 1f;&#10;    public float attackRange = 2f;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;弹药设置&quot;)]&#10;    public bool usesAmmo;&#10;    public int maxAmmo = 30;&#10;    public float reloadTime = 2f;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;音效&quot;)]&#10;    public AudioClip fireSound;&#10;    public AudioClip reloadSound;&#10;&#10;    public float DPS =&gt; damage * attackSpeed;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(fileName = \"NewWeaponData\", menuName = \"Game/Weapon Data\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class WeaponData : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"基础属性\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string weaponName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Sprite icon;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public GameObject prefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"战斗数值\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Range(1, 100)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int damage = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float attackSpeed = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float attackRange = 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"弹药设置\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool usesAmmo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int maxAmmo = 30;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float reloadTime = 2f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"音效\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public AudioClip fireSound;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public AudioClip reloadSound;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float DPS => damage * attackSpeed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用数据配置的组件只需持有 ScriptableObject 的引用，通过 Inspector 拖拽不同的数据资产即可切换武器属性，无需修改任何代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class WeaponController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private WeaponData weaponData;&#10;&#10;    private int currentAmmo;&#10;    private float nextAttackTime;&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        currentAmmo = weaponData.maxAmmo;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Attack()&#10;    {&#10;        if (Time.time &lt; nextAttackTime) return;&#10;&#10;        if (weaponData.usesAmmo &amp;&amp; currentAmmo &lt;= 0) return;&#10;&#10;        PerformAttack();&#10;        nextAttackTime = Time.time + 1f / weaponData.attackSpeed;&#10;&#10;        if (weaponData.usesAmmo)&#10;        {&#10;            currentAmmo--;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void PerformAttack()&#10;    {&#10;        Debug.Log($&quot;{weaponData.weaponName} 造成 {weaponData.damage} 点伤害&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class WeaponController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private WeaponData weaponData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int currentAmmo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float nextAttackTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentAmmo = weaponData.maxAmmo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Attack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Time.time &#x3C; nextAttackTime) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (weaponData.usesAmmo &#x26;&#x26; currentAmmo &#x3C;= 0) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PerformAttack();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nextAttackTime = Time.time + 1f / weaponData.attackSpeed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (weaponData.usesAmmo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentAmmo--;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void PerformAttack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log($\"{weaponData.weaponName} 造成 {weaponData.damage} 点伤害\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式的核心优势在于：100 个相同类型的敌人引用同一份 WeaponData 资产，修改该资产后所有敌人的行为立即更新，且只占用一份内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运行时共享状态\">运行时共享状态</h2><p>ScriptableObject 不仅可以存储静态配置，还能作为运行时的共享状态容器。多个系统通过引用同一个 SO 实例来读写共享数据，实现了无需直接引用彼此的间接通信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Runtime/Player Runtime Data&quot;)]&#10;public class PlayerRuntimeData : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    [Header(&quot;生命值&quot;)]&#10;    public float currentHealth;&#10;    public float maxHealth = 100f;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;资源&quot;)]&#10;    public int coins;&#10;    public int experience;&#10;    public int level;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;位置&quot;)]&#10;    public Vector3 lastCheckpoint;&#10;&#10;    public float HealthPercent =&gt; maxHealth &gt; 0 ? currentHealth / maxHealth : 0f;&#10;&#10;    public void Reset()&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = maxHealth;&#10;        coins = 0;&#10;        experience = 0;&#10;        level = 1;&#10;        lastCheckpoint = Vector3.zero;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        Reset();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Runtime/Player Runtime Data\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PlayerRuntimeData : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"生命值\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float maxHealth = 100f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"资源\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int coins;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int experience;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int level;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"位置\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Vector3 lastCheckpoint;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float HealthPercent => maxHealth > 0 ? currentHealth / maxHealth : 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Reset()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coins = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        experience = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        level = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastCheckpoint = Vector3.zero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Reset();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 运行时共享状态&#10;        A[PlayerRuntimeData SO]&#10;    end&#10;    B[战斗系统] --&gt;|写入 currentHealth| A&#10;    C[UI 系统] --&gt;|读取 HealthPercent| A&#10;    D[存档系统] --&gt;|读写全部字段| A&#10;    E[商店系统] --&gt;|读写 coins| A&#10;    F[升级系统] --&gt;|读写 experience/level| A\">graph LR\n    subgraph 运行时共享状态\n        A[PlayerRuntimeData SO]\n    end\n    B[战斗系统] --&gt;|写入 currentHealth| A\n    C[UI 系统] --&gt;|读取 HealthPercent| A\n    D[存档系统] --&gt;|读写全部字段| A\n    E[商店系统] --&gt;|读写 coins| A\n    F[升级系统] --&gt;|读写 experience/level| A</pre><p>多个系统通过 Inspector 引用同一个 PlayerRuntimeData 资产，战斗系统修改血量后 UI 系统自动读到最新值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class PlayerHUD : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private PlayerRuntimeData playerData;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text coinText;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text levelText;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        healthSlider.value = playerData.HealthPercent;&#10;        coinText.text = playerData.coins.ToString();&#10;        levelText.text = $&quot;Lv.{playerData.level}&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PlayerHUD : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private PlayerRuntimeData playerData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text coinText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text levelText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSlider.value = playerData.HealthPercent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coinText.text = playerData.coins.ToString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        levelText.text = $\"Lv.{playerData.level}\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要注意的关键点：ScriptableObject 在编辑器中的修改是持久的（会写入 .asset 文件），但在构建后的运行时修改只在当前会话有效，退出游戏后恢复原值。通过 <code>OnEnable</code> 中的 Reset 方法可以确保每次进入游戏都是干净的初始状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"枚举式-scriptableobject\">枚举式 ScriptableObject</h2><p>利用 ScriptableObject 的引用语义，可以替代传统枚举实现可扩展的类型系统。每个&quot;枚举值&quot;是一个独立的 SO 资产，新增类型只需创建新资产而无需修改代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Game/Element Type&quot;)]&#10;public class ElementType : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    public string displayName;&#10;    public Color color;&#10;    public Sprite icon;&#10;    public float damageMultiplier = 1f;&#10;}&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Game/Damage Type Relation&quot;)]&#10;public class DamageRelation : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    [System.Serializable]&#10;    public struct Effectiveness&#10;    {&#10;        public ElementType attackerElement;&#10;        public ElementType defenderElement;&#10;        [Range(0f, 3f)]&#10;        public float multiplier;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Effectiveness[] relations;&#10;&#10;    public float GetMultiplier(ElementType attacker, ElementType defender)&#10;    {&#10;        foreach (var relation in relations)&#10;        {&#10;            if (relation.attackerElement == attacker &amp;&amp;&#10;                relation.defenderElement == defender)&#10;            {&#10;                return relation.multiplier;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return 1f;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Game/Element Type\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ElementType : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string displayName;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Color color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Sprite icon;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float damageMultiplier = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Game/Damage Type Relation\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DamageRelation : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [System.Serializable]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public struct Effectiveness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public ElementType attackerElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public ElementType defenderElement;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        [Range(0f, 3f)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        public float multiplier;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Effectiveness[] relations;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float GetMultiplier(ElementType attacker, ElementType defender)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var relation in relations)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (relation.attackerElement == attacker &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                relation.defenderElement == defender)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return relation.multiplier;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>扩展性</th>\n<th>数据附加</th>\n<th>序列化</th>\n<th>运行时修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C# enum</td>\n<td>需改代码重编译</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>int 值</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串常量</td>\n<td>无编译检查</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>可但不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SO 枚举</td>\n<td>创建新资产即可</td>\n<td>任意字段</td>\n<td>引用</td>\n<td>安全可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工厂与策略模式\">工厂与策略模式</h2><p>ScriptableObject 天然适合实现工厂模式和策略模式，将行为逻辑封装在可替换的资产中。通过定义抽象基类，不同的 SO 资产可以实现不同的行为策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public abstract class AttackStrategy : ScriptableObject&#10;{&#10;    public abstract void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage);&#10;}&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Strategies/Melee Attack&quot;)]&#10;public class MeleeAttackStrategy : AttackStrategy&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private float hitRadius = 1.5f;&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject hitEffectPrefab;&#10;&#10;    public override void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage)&#10;    {&#10;        float dist = Vector3.Distance(attacker.position, target.position);&#10;        if (dist &lt;= hitRadius)&#10;        {&#10;            var damageable = target.GetComponent&lt;IDamageable&gt;();&#10;            damageable?.TakeDamage(damage);&#10;&#10;            if (hitEffectPrefab != null)&#10;            {&#10;                Object.Instantiate(hitEffectPrefab, target.position, Quaternion.identity);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = &quot;Strategies/Ranged Attack&quot;)]&#10;public class RangedAttackStrategy : AttackStrategy&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject projectilePrefab;&#10;    [SerializeField] private float projectileSpeed = 20f;&#10;&#10;    public override void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage)&#10;    {&#10;        if (projectilePrefab == null) return;&#10;&#10;        var go = Object.Instantiate(projectilePrefab, attacker.position, attacker.rotation);&#10;        var proj = go.GetComponent&lt;Projectile&gt;();&#10;        proj.Initialize(target, damage, projectileSpeed);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class AttackStrategy : ScriptableObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Strategies/Melee Attack\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class MeleeAttackStrategy : AttackStrategy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float hitRadius = 1.5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject hitEffectPrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float dist = Vector3.Distance(attacker.position, target.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (dist &#x3C;= hitRadius)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var damageable = target.GetComponent&#x3C;IDamageable>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            damageable?.TakeDamage(damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (hitEffectPrefab != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Object.Instantiate(hitEffectPrefab, target.position, Quaternion.identity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = \"Strategies/Ranged Attack\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class RangedAttackStrategy : AttackStrategy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject projectilePrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float projectileSpeed = 20f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void Execute(Transform attacker, Transform target, int damage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (projectilePrefab == null) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var go = Object.Instantiate(projectilePrefab, attacker.position, attacker.rotation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var proj = go.GetComponent&#x3C;Projectile>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        proj.Initialize(target, damage, projectileSpeed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用策略的组件通过 Inspector 切换不同的攻击行为，同一个敌人类可以轻松配置为近战或远程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class EnemyAI : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private AttackStrategy attackStrategy;&#10;    [SerializeField] private int baseDamage = 10;&#10;&#10;    private Transform currentTarget;&#10;&#10;    public void PerformAttack()&#10;    {&#10;        if (currentTarget == null) return;&#10;        attackStrategy.Execute(transform, currentTarget, baseDamage);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class EnemyAI : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private AttackStrategy attackStrategy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private int baseDamage = 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Transform currentTarget;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void PerformAttack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentTarget == null) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        attackStrategy.Execute(transform, currentTarget, baseDamage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 策略模式&#10;        A[EnemyAI] --&gt;|引用| B{AttackStrategy}&#10;        B --&gt;|近战配置| C[MeleeAttackStrategy]&#10;        B --&gt;|远程配置| D[RangedAttackStrategy]&#10;        B --&gt;|魔法配置| E[MagicAttackStrategy]&#10;    end&#10;    C --&gt; F[范围检测 + 特效]&#10;    D --&gt; G[发射弹体]&#10;    E --&gt; H[AOE 伤害]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 策略模式\n        A[EnemyAI] --&gt;|引用| B{AttackStrategy}\n        B --&gt;|近战配置| C[MeleeAttackStrategy]\n        B --&gt;|远程配置| D[RangedAttackStrategy]\n        B --&gt;|魔法配置| E[MagicAttackStrategy]\n    end\n    C --&gt; F[范围检测 + 特效]\n    D --&gt; G[发射弹体]\n    E --&gt; H[AOE 伤害]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((ScriptableObject))&#10;    数据配置&#10;      CreateAssetMenu 创建&#10;      Inspector 可视化编辑&#10;      多对象共享单实例&#10;    运行时状态&#10;      跨系统数据共享&#10;      无需直接引用&#10;      OnEnable 重置&#10;    枚举替代&#10;      可扩展类型系统&#10;      附加任意数据&#10;      无需修改代码&#10;    行为策略&#10;      抽象基类定义接口&#10;      子类实现不同策略&#10;      Inspector 切换行为\">mindmap\n  root((ScriptableObject))\n    数据配置\n      CreateAssetMenu 创建\n      Inspector 可视化编辑\n      多对象共享单实例\n    运行时状态\n      跨系统数据共享\n      无需直接引用\n      OnEnable 重置\n    枚举替代\n      可扩展类型系统\n      附加任意数据\n      无需修改代码\n    行为策略\n      抽象基类定义接口\n      子类实现不同策略\n      Inspector 切换行为</pre><ul>\n<li>ScriptableObject 是不依赖 GameObject 的数据容器，作为资源文件存在于 Project 中</li>\n<li>作为数据配置容器，多个对象引用同一份数据实现内存共享和集中管理</li>\n<li>作为运行时共享状态，多个系统通过同一个 SO 实例间接通信，实现松耦合</li>\n<li>枚举式 SO 通过创建新资产扩展类型系统，比 C# enum 更灵活</li>\n<li>策略模式中 SO 封装可替换的行为逻辑，通过 Inspector 配置不同策略</li>\n<li>编辑器中修改 SO 会持久化，但构建后运行时修改仅在当前会话有效</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ScriptableObject 数据架构","id":"scriptableobject-数据架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据配置容器","id":"数据配置容器"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时共享状态","id":"运行时共享状态"},{"level":2,"text":"枚举式 ScriptableObject","id":"枚举式-scriptableobject"},{"level":2,"text":"工厂与策略模式","id":"工厂与策略模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-scripting/event-system"},"next":{"title":"UGUI 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ugui-fundamentals"}}